<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-8">
    <h1>Welcome to EduChain Passport</h1>
    <p class="lead">Decentralized & privacy-preserving credential verification prototype.</p>

    <h5>Quick actions</h5>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/issuer">Issuer Portal</a> — Issue new credentials (demo)</li>
      <li><a href="/wallet">Student Wallet</a> — View credentials</li>
      <li><a href="/verify">Verifier</a> — Verify credential hash</li>
    </ul>

    <hr>
    <h5>How this prototype works (simple)</h5>
    <ol>
      <li>Issuer issues credential → server creates credential record + hash (simulated blockchain)</li>
      <li>Student views wallet → sees issued credentials</li>
      <li>Employer verifies by entering hash → server checks simulated chain</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4">
    <div class="card p-3">
      <h6>Pro tip for demo</h6>
      <p>After issuing a credential note down the hash and paste it into Verify page to demo verification.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
